#| msgid ""
#| "The B<fputws> function is the wide-character equivalent of the B<fputs> "
#| "function. It writes the wide character string starting at I<ws>, up to "
#| "but not including the terminating L'\\e0' character, to I<stream>."
msgid ""
"The B<fputws>()  function is the wide-character equivalent of the "
"B<fputs>(3)  function.  It writes the wide-character string starting at "
"I<ws>, up to but not including the terminating null wide character "
"(L\\[aq]\\e0\\[aq]), to I<stream>."
msgstr ""
"La función B<fputws> es equivalente para caracteres anchos a la función "
"B<fputs>. Escribe la cadena de caracteres anchos que comienza en I<ws> y "
"termina en un carácter L'\\e0' (sin incluir a éste), en I<flujo>."

